[E0449] Error: `labelled` keeps `self`, and `Labels` does not say it may
    ╭─[ err/508_keeps_self_refused/main.wip:27:8 ]
    │
 23 │     fn labelled(labels: &var Vec<Label>)
    │        ────┬───
    │            ╰───── declared here, keeping less
    │
 27 │     fn labelled(labels: &var Vec<Label>) keeps self = {}
    │        ────┬───
    │            ╰───── keeps `self`
    │
    │ Note: a call through the interface keeps only what the interface's `keeps` names, so an implementation keeps no more
────╯
